WEBVTT

00:07.827 --> 00:09.068
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.137 --> 00:10.896
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.965 --> 00:12.413
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.482 --> 00:14.586
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.655 --> 00:17.482
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.551 --> 00:19.586
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.655 --> 00:21.655
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.724 --> 00:23.517
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.586 --> 00:25.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.517 --> 00:27.620
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.689 --> 00:29.620
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.689 --> 00:31.620
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.689 --> 00:33.586
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.655 --> 00:35.448
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.517 --> 00:37.689
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.758 --> 00:39.586
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.655 --> 00:40.965
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:41.034 --> 00:42.793
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.862 --> 00:45.551
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.620 --> 00:47.827
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.896 --> 00:49.517
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.586 --> 00:53.551
[whimsical nautical music]
[异想天开的航海音乐]

00:53.620 --> 01:00.586
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.793 --> 01:04.068
- [laughs]
We are going
- [笑]
我们要去

01:04.137 --> 01:07.103
to have so much fun!
玩得开心！

01:07.172 --> 01:08.965
A weekend in a cabin
in the woods
在小屋里度过一个周末
在树林里

01:09.034 --> 01:11.034
with the Gal Pals!
和 Gal Pals 一起！

01:11.103 --> 01:12.862
all: Gal pals!
全体：姐妹们！

01:12.931 --> 01:14.931
Yeah!
是的！

01:15.000 --> 01:17.034
- [exclaims]
- Oh, a krabby patty.
- [惊呼]
- 哦，蟹肉饼。

01:17.103 --> 01:18.206
- Oh.
- 哦。

01:18.275 --> 01:19.965
- Perfect.
- Ugh.
- 完美的。
- 呃。

01:20.034 --> 01:22.655
- The engine needed greasing.
- 发动机需要润滑。

01:22.724 --> 01:24.965
- [exclaims]
Yah!
- [惊呼]
啊！

01:25.034 --> 01:26.931
Congratulations, Mrs. Puff!
恭喜你，普芙女士！

01:27.000 --> 01:29.586
Your boat and trailer
just got hitched!
您的船和拖车
刚刚结婚！

01:29.655 --> 01:31.034
[laughs]
[笑]

01:31.103 --> 01:32.724
[all laughing]
[Karen beeping]
[全都笑了]
[凯伦嘟嘟声]

01:32.793 --> 01:36.068
- Hmm, I wonder what's keeping
our newest Gal Pal?
- Hmm, I wonder what's keeping
我们最新的 Gal Pal？

01:36.137 --> 01:39.137
[thundering steps]
【雷霆脚步】

01:39.206 --> 01:41.482
- This is gonna be so funny.
- 这会很有趣。

01:41.551 --> 01:44.758
The Gal Pals will obviously
try to prank the newbie,
Gal Pals 显然会
尝试恶作剧新手，

01:44.827 --> 01:47.620
but this newbie
is gonna prank them right back.
但是这个新手
马上就要恶作剧他们了

01:47.689 --> 01:50.000
[laughs]
- Boo!
[笑]
- 嘘！

01:50.068 --> 01:52.000
Who likes eggs?
[laughs]
谁喜欢鸡蛋？
[笑]

01:52.068 --> 01:53.620
- Not now, SpongeBob.
- 海绵宝宝，现在不行。

01:53.689 --> 01:55.655
Wait until you're around
the campfire.
等到你在身边
篝火。

01:55.724 --> 01:59.275
And you're supposed
to act scary, not lame.
而你应该
表现得可怕，而不是跛脚。

01:59.344 --> 02:02.275
- Oh, scary.
Got it!
- 哦，可怕。
知道了！

02:02.344 --> 02:04.862
Wait until the fire
then make with the scary.
等到火烧起来
然后与可怕的人一起做。

02:04.931 --> 02:08.172
[goofy exclamations]
[愚蠢的感叹]

02:08.241 --> 02:10.655
[wails, grunts]
[哀号，咕噜声]

02:10.724 --> 02:12.965
- Keep working on it.
- 继续努力。

02:13.034 --> 02:15.310
- Here comes
our newest member!
- 来了
我们的最新成员！

02:15.379 --> 02:17.931
all: Gal Pals!
Yeah!
全体： 好朋友们！
是的！

02:18.000 --> 02:21.103
[all chattering, laughing]
[大家叽叽喳喳，大笑]

02:21.172 --> 02:24.000
- Here, let me get your bag.
[grunts]
- 来，我来拿你的包。
[咕哝]

02:24.068 --> 02:26.689
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

02:26.758 --> 02:29.379
- Ow.
[grunts]
- 噢。
[咕哝]

02:29.448 --> 02:31.689
[door creaks, closes]
[门吱吱作响，关上]

02:31.758 --> 02:33.586
Nice and cozy.
美好而温馨。

02:33.655 --> 02:36.068
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

02:36.137 --> 02:37.586
all: ♪ We're Gal Pals ♪
全体：♪ 我们是好朋友 ♪

02:37.655 --> 02:39.931
♪ And, yes, we shall
conquer the world one day ♪
♪ 而且，是的，我们将
总有一天会征服世界♪

02:40.000 --> 02:42.068
♪ We're no sea bunnies,
we're smart and funny ♪
♪ 我们不是海兔，
我们又聪明又有趣♪

02:42.137 --> 02:43.862
♪ And we demand equal pay ♪
♪ 我们要求同工同酬 ♪

02:43.931 --> 02:47.862
♪ We'll shout "Gal Pals"
right into your ear canal ♪
♪ 我们会喊“Gal Pals”
直接进入你的耳道♪

02:47.931 --> 02:49.724
♪ And bang it on a drum ♪
♪ 然后敲鼓 ♪

02:49.793 --> 02:51.724
♪ We're sweet and nice,
but take our advice ♪
♪ 我们又可爱又友善，
但请接受我们的建议♪

02:51.793 --> 02:53.206
♪ Cross us and you'll be chum ♪
[creature bellows]
♪ 与我们联系，你会成为好朋友的 ♪
[生物咆哮]

02:53.275 --> 02:55.310
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

02:55.379 --> 02:58.241
[creature grunting, munching]
[生物咕噜声、咀嚼声]

02:58.310 --> 03:01.310
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:01.379 --> 03:04.137
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

03:04.206 --> 03:08.000
- Ooh, this is gonna be
so much fun!
- 哦，这将会是
太有趣了！

03:08.068 --> 03:09.724
We're gonna have
a real adventure
我们将会有
一次真正的冒险

03:09.793 --> 03:12.482
with our newbie,
aren't we, ladies?
和我们的新手一起，
女士们，我们不是吗？

03:12.551 --> 03:15.241
[all laughing deviously]
[Karen beeps]
[大家都奸笑]
[凯伦嘟嘟声]

03:15.310 --> 03:17.034
- [laughs nervously]
- [紧张地笑]

03:17.103 --> 03:19.000
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

03:19.068 --> 03:22.310
[laughing deviously]
[狡猾地笑]

03:22.379 --> 03:24.620
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

03:24.689 --> 03:28.068
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

03:28.137 --> 03:29.965
- Whoa!
- 哇！

03:30.034 --> 03:32.310
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:32.379 --> 03:34.862
[wails, grunts]
[哀号，咕噜声]

03:34.931 --> 03:37.586
[babbling, groaning]
[胡言乱语，呻吟]

03:37.655 --> 03:40.724
Whoa!
[yells, grunts]
哇！
[喊叫，咕哝]

03:40.793 --> 03:42.482
Huh?
啊？

03:42.551 --> 03:44.862
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:44.931 --> 03:47.034
Where am I?
我在哪里？

03:47.103 --> 03:50.448
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

03:50.517 --> 03:52.068
Huh?
啊？

03:52.137 --> 03:55.172
All right, I'll just sit tight
and wait to hear from Pearl.
好吧，我就坐稳了
等待珍珠的消息。

03:55.241 --> 03:56.413
I've got the trailer,
我有预告片

03:56.482 --> 03:58.793
so there's plenty of food
and blankets.
所以有很多食物
和毯子。

03:58.862 --> 04:00.965
[glum music]
[忧郁的音乐]

04:01.034 --> 04:02.620
[mud burbling]
[泥浆潺潺]

04:02.689 --> 04:04.275
- [growls]
Barnacles!
- [咆哮]
藤壶！

04:04.344 --> 04:06.034
Now what am I gonna do?
现在我该怎么办？

04:06.103 --> 04:08.275
Hey, a peanut!
嘿，一颗花生！

04:08.344 --> 04:10.103
A lucky peanut!
幸运花生！

04:10.172 --> 04:11.862
Mm, I'm not gonna go hungry
out here.
嗯，我不会挨饿的
在这里。

04:11.931 --> 04:15.758
I'm gonna survive!
[voice echoes]
我会活下去！
[声音回声]

04:15.827 --> 04:19.206
Wait a minute,
I can't eat this peanut.
等一下，
我不能吃这个花生。

04:19.275 --> 04:21.827
You're my lucky peanut.
[giggles]
你是我的幸运花生。
[咯咯笑]

04:21.896 --> 04:25.827
I've got a lucky peanut!
[voice echoes]
我有一个幸运花生！
[声音回声]

04:25.896 --> 04:27.827
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

04:27.896 --> 04:29.655
- Here we are.
- 我们到了。

04:29.724 --> 04:31.965
- Uh-oh, looks like
we lost something.
- 呃哦，看起来像
我们失去了一些东西。

04:32.034 --> 04:35.655
- [gasps]
Oh, no, my backpack!
- [喘气]
哦，不，我的背包！

04:35.724 --> 04:39.000
This is the worst thing
that could ever happen!
这是最糟糕的事情
这可能会发生！

04:39.068 --> 04:40.931
- Aww, there, there, sweetie.
- 哇哦，那里，那里，亲爱的。

04:41.000 --> 04:43.620
It's just a backpack.
We can buy you a new one.
这只是一个背包。
我们可以给你买一件新的。

04:43.689 --> 04:47.724
It's not like losing a friend.
这不像失去朋友。

04:47.793 --> 04:51.275
- [whimpers]
She must be psychic.
- [呜咽]
她一定是有灵性的。

04:51.344 --> 04:55.103
- Aww, heck,
we'll just have to rough it!
- 哇，哎呀，
我们只能艰难地度过！

04:55.172 --> 04:58.206
[mice squeaking]
[creature snarling]
[老鼠吱吱声]
[生物咆哮]

04:58.275 --> 04:59.689
[substance burbles, splats]
[物质沸腾、溅出]

04:59.758 --> 05:02.275
All right, gals,
let's not just hang here
好吧，姑娘们，
我们不要只是挂在这里

05:02.344 --> 05:03.655
like mama's washing!
就像妈妈洗衣服一样！

05:03.724 --> 05:06.758
Time to gussy up the place!
是时候打扮一下这个地方了！

05:06.827 --> 05:09.758
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

05:09.827 --> 05:13.931
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:14.000 --> 05:15.275
Hmm.
唔。

05:15.344 --> 05:16.965
- Good thing we have
a Texas tornado
- 好东西我们有
德克萨斯州龙卷风

05:17.034 --> 05:18.448
among the Gal Pals.
Gal Pals 中。

05:18.517 --> 05:21.931
Who knew you could
use a jellyfish as a recharger?
谁知道你可以
用水母当充电器？

05:22.000 --> 05:24.862
[jellyfish buzzing]
[electricity zapping]
[水母嗡嗡声]
[电击]

05:24.931 --> 05:27.551
- Oh, yeah.
[sighs]
- 哦，是的。
[叹气]

05:27.620 --> 05:31.517
- Yep, nature always provides.
- 是的，大自然总是提供。

05:31.586 --> 05:33.586
- Hey, where's the newbie?
- 嘿，新人在哪里？

05:33.655 --> 05:34.862
- Oh...
- 哦...

05:34.931 --> 05:37.241
Oh, please, SpongeBob,
be all right.
哦，拜托，海绵宝宝，
没事吧。

05:37.310 --> 05:39.068
[phone line ringing]
[电话铃声响起]

05:39.137 --> 05:41.551
- [goofy babbling]
- [愚蠢的胡言乱语]

05:41.620 --> 05:44.896
I'm Sponge-zan
of the brine apes!
我是海绵赞
盐水猿！

05:44.965 --> 05:46.793
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

05:46.862 --> 05:49.103
[yelps, groans]
[尖叫声、呻吟声]

05:49.172 --> 05:51.344
Ooh!
[grunts]
哦！
[咕哝]

05:51.413 --> 05:52.793
[phone rings]
[电话铃声]

05:52.862 --> 05:55.206
Oh, my lucky peanut's ringing.
[goofy exclamation]
哦，我的幸运花生响了。
[愚蠢的感叹]

05:55.275 --> 05:56.344
Hello?
你好？

05:56.413 --> 05:57.344
[ringing continues]
[铃声继续]

05:57.413 --> 05:58.758
Oh.
[grunts]
哦。
[咕哝]

05:58.827 --> 06:00.827
Shell-lo?
[laughs]
贝壳洛？
[笑]

06:00.896 --> 06:02.000
- SpongeBob!
- 海绵宝宝！

06:02.068 --> 06:04.241
Oh, thank Neptune
you're still alive.
哦，谢谢海王星
你还活着。

06:04.310 --> 06:06.551
- Don't worry, Pearl,
I'm still gonna do the prank.
- 别担心，珍珠，
我还是要搞恶作剧。

06:06.620 --> 06:08.379
I just have to find your cabin.
我只需要找到你的小屋。

06:08.448 --> 06:10.655
Are there any landmarks
I can head to?
有没有什么地标
我可以去吗？

06:10.724 --> 06:14.275
- Um, well,
there are a lot of trees.
- 嗯，好吧，
有很多树。

06:14.344 --> 06:15.551
- Trees, perfect!
- 树，完美！

06:15.620 --> 06:17.827
I'll just follow the trees.
我就跟着树走吧。

06:17.896 --> 06:19.931
Are you sure you didn't ring,
too, lucky peanut?
你确定你没响吗
还有，幸运花生？

06:20.000 --> 06:23.103
Hello, hello?
Ugh, bad reception.
喂，喂？
呃，接待不好。

06:23.172 --> 06:24.758
No peanut bars.
没有花生棒。

06:24.827 --> 06:26.068
[peanut beeping]
[花生嘟嘟声]

06:26.137 --> 06:28.000
Eh.
呃。

06:28.068 --> 06:29.482
Follow the trees!
跟着树走！

06:29.551 --> 06:31.241
Follow the trees,
follow the trees,
跟随树木，
跟随树木，

06:31.310 --> 06:32.862
follow the trees,
follow the trees,
跟随树木，
跟随树木，

06:32.931 --> 06:34.310
follow the trees,
follow the trees...
跟随树木，
跟随树木...

06:34.379 --> 06:36.724
[voice fades]
[声音渐弱]

06:36.793 --> 06:39.275
[all laughing]
- [sighs]
[全都笑了]
- [叹气]

06:39.344 --> 06:41.034
[all chuckle]
[全场笑声]

06:41.103 --> 06:45.379
- [slurps] Oh, this kelp cocoa
is delicious.
- [咕噜咕噜]哦，这个海带可可
很好吃。

06:45.448 --> 06:46.827
[scanner whirs, beeps]
[扫描仪嗡嗡作响，嘟嘟声]

06:46.896 --> 06:51.241
- Yeah, my sensors indicate
an agreeable flavor.
- 是的，我的传感器表明
令人愉快的味道。

06:51.310 --> 06:52.965
- Okay, Gal Pals,
- 好吧，姑娘们，

06:53.034 --> 06:57.000
it's time to initiate
our newest member.
是时候开始了
我们的最新成员。

06:57.068 --> 06:59.068
[sinister music]
[险恶的音乐]

06:59.137 --> 07:00.758
- [whines]
- [grunts]
- [哀嚎]
- [咕哝]

07:00.827 --> 07:03.172
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

07:03.241 --> 07:05.724
- You are now a Gal Pal.
- 你现在是一个 Gal Pal。

07:05.793 --> 07:08.448
- That's it?
Just this necklace?
- 就是这样？
就这个项链吗？

07:08.517 --> 07:11.137
No swats or parading around
in my PJs?
禁止殴打或四处游行
在我的睡衣里？

07:11.206 --> 07:14.206
No trying to scare me
with urban legends?
别想吓唬我
与都市传说？

07:14.275 --> 07:17.275
- Why would we do that?
- Yeah, we like you.
- 我们为什么要这么做？
- 是的，我们喜欢你。

07:17.344 --> 07:18.586
- We haven't had
a fourth member
-我们没有过
第四名成员

07:18.655 --> 07:20.482
since that incident
with Flibberty Gibbet.
自从那次事件以来
与 Flibberty Gibbet 一起。

07:20.551 --> 07:21.896
I--
- Puff!
我——
- 噗！

07:21.965 --> 07:24.103
Shh.
嘘。

07:24.172 --> 07:26.620
- Who's "Slippery Giveth"?
- “滑溜溜的给予”是谁？

07:26.689 --> 07:29.551
- Oh, Flibberty Gibbet.
-哦，轻浮绞刑架。

07:29.620 --> 07:32.034
She was the fourth member
of our group.
她是第四位成员
我们组的。

07:32.103 --> 07:34.379
We had a fight with her
years ago
我们和她吵架了
几年前

07:34.448 --> 07:36.413
right here at this very cabin
就在这个小屋里

07:36.482 --> 07:39.206
one dark and stormy night.
一个漆黑而暴风雨的夜晚。

07:39.275 --> 07:40.931
[thunder crashes]
[雷霆轰鸣]

07:41.000 --> 07:44.517
- We don't even remember
what the fight was about.
-我们甚至不记得了
这场战斗是关于什么的。

07:44.586 --> 07:47.448
- It sure was a humdinger
of an argument!
- 这确实是一个嗡嗡声
一个争论！

07:47.517 --> 07:49.551
- She went bananas
- 她发疯了

07:49.620 --> 07:52.034
and vowed to destroy
并发誓要摧毁

07:52.103 --> 07:54.379
any and all Gal Pals.
任何和所有的 Gal Pals。

07:54.448 --> 07:55.689
[imitates slicing]
[模仿切片]

07:55.758 --> 07:58.724
- Then she just ran off
into these woods!
- 然后她就跑掉了
进入这些树林！

07:58.793 --> 08:01.724
- Some say
she's still out there,
- 有人说
她还在外面，

08:01.793 --> 08:05.517
all hot-headed
and waiting to get her revenge.
头脑发热
并等待着为她报仇。

08:05.586 --> 08:06.931
[wails]
[哀号]

08:07.000 --> 08:08.344
- That's her pendant
you're wearing.
- 那是她的吊坠
你穿着。

08:08.413 --> 08:10.586
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

08:10.655 --> 08:12.413
"Flibberty Gibbit"?
“轻浮的吉比特”？

08:12.482 --> 08:14.103
[screams, grunts]
[尖叫声、咕哝声]

08:14.172 --> 08:15.586
[hollers]
[喊叫]

08:15.655 --> 08:17.482
Why did you give me that?
你为什么给我那个？

08:17.551 --> 08:19.896
Why did you take me here?
你为什么带我来这里？

08:19.965 --> 08:22.482
[all laughing]
[全都笑了]

08:22.551 --> 08:24.448
[laughs]
[笑]

08:24.517 --> 08:27.000
Thanks, gals, you got me.
谢谢，姑娘们，你们抓住了我。

08:27.068 --> 08:29.000
But I knew
you were gonna prank me.
但我知道
你本来想恶作剧我的。

08:29.068 --> 08:30.551
- Sure you did.
- [laughs]
- 当然你做到了。
- [笑]

08:30.620 --> 08:32.448
You should have seen your face.
- [growling]
你应该看到你的脸。
- [咆哮]

08:32.517 --> 08:34.379
- We got you good!
- 我们让你很好！

08:34.448 --> 08:36.827
- [laughs]
Mm, Gal Pals.
- [笑]
嗯，加尔朋友。

08:36.896 --> 08:39.344
[tree crashes]
[all scream, whimper]
[树倒塌]
[所有人尖叫，呜咽]

08:39.413 --> 08:40.551
- [gasps] What was that?
- [喘气] 那是什么？

08:40.620 --> 08:42.586
- 'Kay, you can stop
trying to scare me.
- '凯，你可以停下来了
试图吓唬我。

08:42.655 --> 08:46.034
I know Flipperty Giblets
is a prank.
我知道 Flipperty 内脏
是一个恶作剧。

08:46.103 --> 08:49.103
- Flibberty Gibbet
is partly true.
- 轻浮绞刑架
部分属实。

08:49.172 --> 08:50.793
- She was a Gal Pal.
- 她是一个 Gal Pal。

08:50.862 --> 08:53.068
We did have a fight with her.
我们确实和她吵过架。

08:53.137 --> 08:56.241
- And she did run off
into these woods.
- 她确实逃跑了
进入这些树林。

08:56.310 --> 08:58.586
- Wait, that was all the parts!
- 等等，这就是所有的部分了！

08:58.655 --> 09:00.137
[crashing]
[崩溃]

09:00.206 --> 09:02.034
- [growls, snarls]
- [咆哮，咆哮]

09:02.103 --> 09:03.896
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

09:03.965 --> 09:05.758
- Quick, let's hide
in the cabin!
- 快点，我们躲起来
在机舱里！

09:05.827 --> 09:08.724
- Wait, it--it's okay.
It's only SpongeBob.
- 等等，这——没关系。
这只是海绵宝宝。

09:08.793 --> 09:11.724
I asked him to make noise
and prank you.
我请他发出声音
并恶作剧你。

09:11.793 --> 09:14.586
All right, SpongeBob,
you can come out!
好吧，海绵宝宝，
你可以出来了！

09:14.655 --> 09:17.172
I'm canceling the prank!
我要取消恶作剧了！

09:17.241 --> 09:20.448
- [stifled laughter]
- [压抑的笑声]

09:20.517 --> 09:22.724
There's another tree.
还有一棵树。

09:22.793 --> 09:25.000
[pants]
And another tree.
[裤子]
还有另一棵树。

09:25.068 --> 09:27.758
Wow, following the trees
really works.
哇，跟着树走
真的有效。

09:27.827 --> 09:31.103
Tree, tree, tree, tree.
树，树，树，树。

09:31.172 --> 09:34.896
- So, SpongeBob thinks
he can prank us, huh?
- 所以，海绵宝宝认为
他可以恶作剧我们，是吧？

09:34.965 --> 09:37.482
We'll prank him right back.
我们马上就恶作剧回来。

09:37.551 --> 09:39.793
We can rig up the cabin
with trap doors,
我们可以组装小屋
带有活板门，

09:39.862 --> 09:42.689
flying ghosts,
and a thousand cadavers
飞行的幽灵，
和一千具尸体

09:42.758 --> 09:45.689
in a zombie ballroom!
在僵尸舞厅里！

09:45.758 --> 09:47.896
Ooh, what am I saying?
哦，我在说什么？

09:47.965 --> 09:50.413
- Let's scale it down a smidge.
- 让我们把它缩小一点。

09:50.482 --> 09:51.896
- Yeah, let's hide
behind this tree
- 是啊，我们躲起来吧
在这棵树后面

09:51.965 --> 09:53.758
and scream when he shows up.
当他出现时尖叫。

09:53.827 --> 09:56.103
[all giggle]
- You coming, Pearl?
[大家咯咯笑]
- 你来吗，珀尔？

09:56.172 --> 09:58.103
- Well, I'm certainly not
staying by myself
- 嗯，我当然不是
我一个人呆着

09:58.172 --> 09:59.241
here in the dark.
在黑暗中。

09:59.310 --> 10:02.344
[all giggle]
- Shh, he's coming.
[大家咯咯笑]
- 嘘，他来了。

10:02.413 --> 10:04.344
Wait for it.
等等吧。

10:04.413 --> 10:06.793
Now!
[all scream]
现在！
[所有人尖叫]

10:06.862 --> 10:09.931
[all exclaim]
- [roars]
[所有人惊呼]
- [咆哮]

10:10.000 --> 10:12.586
all: Flibberty Gibbet!
[all scream]
所有人： 愚蠢的绞刑架！
[所有人尖叫]

10:12.655 --> 10:14.172
- It's her!
- 是她！

10:14.241 --> 10:17.448
Oh, s-she looks like she's been
in the woods too long!
噢，她——她看起来好像已经
在树林里呆太久了！

10:17.517 --> 10:18.931
- I have a plan.
- 我有一个计划。

10:19.000 --> 10:21.103
We'll run out the back door
and into Puff's boat.
我们会从后门跑出去
and into Puff's boat.

10:21.172 --> 10:22.172
Count of three.
数到三。

10:22.241 --> 10:24.758
One, two, three!
[all screaming]
一二三！
[所有人尖叫]

10:24.827 --> 10:26.724
- [roars, screams]
- [咆哮，尖叫]

10:26.793 --> 10:30.310
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

10:30.379 --> 10:32.275
- Let's go!
- 我们走吧！

10:32.344 --> 10:35.068
- [roars]
- [咆哮]

10:35.137 --> 10:37.000
- Rawr!
- 劳尔！

10:37.068 --> 10:38.275
Hmm?
唔？

10:38.344 --> 10:40.758
Huh.
[goofy babbling]
呵呵。
[胡言乱语]

10:40.827 --> 10:42.793
- No, no!
- SpongeBob!
- 不，不！
- 海绵宝宝！

10:42.862 --> 10:44.655
- Don't go in!
- Oh, hello.
- 别进去！
- 哦，你好。

10:44.724 --> 10:46.482
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

10:46.551 --> 10:48.000
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

10:48.068 --> 10:49.103
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

10:49.172 --> 10:51.689
- Gal Pals,
we have to save SpongeBob!
- 加尔朋友们，
我们必须拯救海绵宝宝！

10:51.758 --> 10:54.482
[whining]
all: Gal Pals.
[抱怨]
全部： Gal Pals。

10:54.551 --> 10:56.482
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

10:56.551 --> 10:59.655
- Wow!
- [growls]
- 哇！
- [咆哮]

10:59.724 --> 11:01.931
- Ooh, another pinecone
on a stick!
- 哦，另一个松果
在一根棍子上！

11:02.000 --> 11:03.448
I love it.
我喜欢它。

11:03.517 --> 11:06.448
- [growls]
- Wow!
- [咆哮]
- 哇！

11:06.517 --> 11:08.655
- I'm gonna get one of these
for each of the Gal Pals.
- 我要买其中一件
对于每个 Gal Pals 来说。

11:08.724 --> 11:10.448
all: Huh?
- [laughs]
全体：啊？
- [笑]

11:10.517 --> 11:13.793
It's only a cabin-to-cabin
country sales lady.
这只是一个舱对舱
乡村销售小姐。

11:13.862 --> 11:15.724
Not Flibberty Gibbet at all.
根本不是轻浮的绞刑架。

11:15.793 --> 11:18.172
- Did someone say my name?
- 有人说了我的名字吗？

11:18.241 --> 11:21.172
Hi, gals!
all: Flibberty Gibbet!
嗨，姑娘们！
所有人： 愚蠢的绞刑架！

11:21.241 --> 11:24.206
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

11:24.275 --> 11:26.724
[whimsical music]
[异想天开的音乐]

11:26.793 --> 11:30.103
- I--I just wanted to say
all's forgiven!
- 我--我只是想说
一切都被原谅了！

11:30.172 --> 11:31.586
- Hey, wait!
- 嘿，等等！

11:31.655 --> 11:35.724
You'll need my lucky peanut!
你需要我的幸运花生！

11:35.793 --> 11:38.103
all: Gal Pals!
[all grunt]
全体： 好朋友们！
[全都咕哝]

11:38.172 --> 11:40.137
[all groan]
[全都呻吟]

11:44.931 --> 11:52.034
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪